# GLM-5.3-Flash a4e3s (KLD 0.043) + MTP (2-token probabilistic drafts, 64K draft vocab), 64K f16 ctx, ub 1024, on the unified build.
# Chat 28.6 / code 30.1 tok/s, decode 29.9 @32K (+2.5 / +2.5 / +10% vs the efe3626b1 build); needle 15/15 @60K, agentic 5/5 (2026-10-16).
# Needs the 120 GiB GTT pool, no GUI, kho=off; ~7-9 GiB stays free, so run it with a MemAvailable watchdog.
# Set as env vars (the GLM series' RDNA3 matvec workgroup rule, opt-in on this build): GGML_VK_DMMV_LARGE_MAX_M=1024 GGML_VK_DMMV_LARGE_MIN_K=8192
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/GLM-5.3-Flash-a4e3s/GLM-5.3-Flash-a4e3s-00001-of-00004.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=glm-5.3-flash
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp 529ac893e + patches/llama.cpp-halo (Vulkan)
MODEL_ARGS="--jinja -ngl 99 -ub 1024 --load-mode none -c 65536 --parallel 1 -ctxcp 4 --cache-ram 0 --spec-type draft-mtp --spec-draft-n-max 2 --spec-draft-ubatch 128 --spec-draft-sampling probabilistic --spec-draft-vocab /models/GLM-5.3-Flash-a4e3s/glm-dv-65536.bin"
